msgctxt "#32040"
msgid "Thanks for using Aeon Tajo, I really hope you enjoy it! Creating and maintaining a skin for Kodi is very hard and requires hundreds of hours of work. If you like Aeon Tajo and you’re willing to support it, you’ll get:[CR][CR] [B]***[/B] Exclusive access to hidden Aeon Tajo’s features, such as browsing and playing of the user’s extra content directly from media views, and some more. [CR] [B]***[/B] Frequent updates of Aeon Tajo, containing new features and bug fixes. [CR] [B]***[/B] Videos, media packs and articles with detailed instructions to take advantage of the many features of Aeon Tajo to the full. [CR][CR]For more information, visit [B][COLOR=themecolor]patreon.com[/B][/COLOR] and search for the creator [COLOR=themecolor][B]Aeon Tajo[/B][/COLOR], or go to [COLOR=themecolor][B]patreon.com/aeontajo[/B][/COLOR]. Thanks!"
msgstr "感谢使用 Aeon Tajo，希望你喜欢它！为 Kodi 创建和维护皮肤费时费力。如果你喜欢 Aeon Tajo 并愿意支持它，你将获得：[CR][CR][B]***[/B]专享访问 Aeon Tajo 的隐藏功能，例如直接从媒体视图浏览和播放用户的额外内容，等等。[CR][B]***[/B]Aeon Tajo 的频繁更新，包含新功能和错误修复。[CR][B]***[/B]视频、媒体包和文章，其中包含详细说明，帮你充分利用 Aeon Tajo 的功能。[CR][CR]更多信息，请访问 [B][COLOR=themecolor]patreon.com[/B][/COLOR] 并搜索创建者 [COLOR=themescolor][B]Aeon Tajo[/B][/COLOR]，或访问 [COLOR=themecolor][B]patreon.com/aeontajo[/B][COLOR]。谢谢！"

